OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEastern      
OL,6,Fareas will hold onto patchy rain this  
OL,7,Fevening, though clear intervals are    
OL,8,Flikely further west, here patches of   
OL,9,Ffog may form for a time. Overnight,    
OL,10,Fcloud will thicken as wet and rather   
OL,11,Fblustery weather arrives from the      
OL,12,Fsouth.                                 
OL,14,CSaturday:FSaturday will be an          
OL,15,Funsettled day. It will be cloudy and   
OL,16,Fbreezy with outbreaks of rain, some of 
OL,17,Fwhich will be heavy, especially around 
OL,18,Fthe middle of the day.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
